The Chinese have fled Ganymede, and we assume them to be regrouping on Elysium for a counter-attack. The portal they used to leave was deactivated as they left, and is now only of use to us as scrap. However, we have located what we assume to be the hub of their portal network, by tracking the signal used to shut down the first portal. We must seize this main Pegasus from its defenders before the main Chinese force can return from Elysium. We believe that the garrison at the gateway will fight to the bitter end, so, to avoid undue losses, we will mount a diversionary attack on some Chinese silos a few miles away from the hub, which we hope will lure many of the garrison away.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
 - Wait for the diversion to begin.
 - Launch a strike on the remaining defenders to take control of the Pegasus hub.
 - Complete the assault within 11 minutes; the cockpit timer shows the time left.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
For this mission, you have a squadron of the new Red Devil light strike vehicles under your command. We are still experimenting with different armament configurations, so for this mission, you will have SP Stabbers fitted, and extra armor. You should find the Red Devil a great boon against the Chinese and their cloaks, on account of their speed and maneuverability.